
### Get all lists
GET http://localhost:1904/lists?q=Sport Lisboa e Benfica

### Create a new list
POST http://localhost:1904/lists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New List",
  "description": "Description of the new list"
}

### Get List
GET http://localhost:1904/lists/dskjhfjksdhjfksdh

### Update a list
PUT http://localhost:1904/lists/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 3209c1b9-50b7-43b6-967b-e0f1ce6ba186

{
  "name": "Updated List",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Delete a list
DELETE http://localhost:1904/lists/1

### Add an item to a list
POST http://localhost:1904/lists/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Apples",
  "quantity": 4
}

### Delete an item from a list
DELETE http://localhost:1904/lists/1/items/2

### Toggle an item's bought status
POST http://localhost:1904/lists/1/items/2/toggle